WEBVTT

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:13.900
Time crawls as if in a dream...

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:21.790
It swirls around the crimson sunset.

00:00:22.210 --> 00:00:29.710
The fleeting utterance of the Haniwa...

00:00:29.710 --> 00:00:41.430
scatters haphazardly for thousands of years.

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:47.050
Chapter Five

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:47.050
Saniwa

00:02:33.980 --> 00:02:37.310
The world will cast off anything that's worthless.

00:02:37.310 --> 00:02:39.770
This is the law of nature.

00:02:54.670 --> 00:02:59.960
Bacteria evolved into fish and, in turn, transformed into other species before finally arriving at the human form.

00:02:59.960 --> 00:03:03.550
During that process, all worthless species were weeded out.

00:03:03.920 --> 00:03:08.100
And now, the time has come for humans to disappear as well.

00:03:08.100 --> 00:03:14.810
We will spawn a new species: the next branch in the evolutionary chain.

00:03:48.010 --> 00:03:51.180
We're running out of guinea pigs.

00:03:51.890 --> 00:03:57.940
Even though I inject all of them with samples of Kuromitsu's blood, only a few of them manifest powers such as yours.

00:03:57.940 --> 00:04:00.270
The majority are duds.

00:04:00.270 --> 00:04:02.650
We need more guinea pigs.

00:04:02.650 --> 00:04:05.690
If I can't have that, then more
of Kuromitsu's blood would be nice.

00:04:06.360 --> 00:04:09.030
That's your job, isn't it?

00:04:09.410 --> 00:04:12.700
If you fail in your duties, you'll be weeded out too.

00:04:13.700 --> 00:04:14.580
Go.

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:16.330
Yes, Sir.

00:04:20.380 --> 00:04:22.880
Even with steel skin like yours,

00:04:22.880 --> 00:04:26.130
you still can't hold your ground against a bloodthirsty attacker?

00:04:26.130 --> 00:04:28.170
So here's the critical question...

00:04:30.180 --> 00:04:33.180
You're caught behind enemy lines...

00:04:33.180 --> 00:04:35.180
Do you press on?

00:04:35.180 --> 00:04:37.100
Or do you retreat?

00:04:37.100 --> 00:04:38.480
Which option would you choose?

00:04:38.980 --> 00:04:40.350
What nonsense.

00:04:54.160 --> 00:04:55.160
Enough!

00:04:57.200 --> 00:05:00.620
That's enough, Kurumazo. You must restrain yourself.

00:05:01.580 --> 00:05:04.540
Kagetsu. Why do you stop me?

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:12.010
Why waste your energy attacking a useless fool who's
responsible for the obliteration of his entire platoon?

00:05:12.450 --> 00:05:15.560
In the end, he's no better than a lizard.

00:05:16.060 --> 00:05:18.560
That's true!

00:05:20.020 --> 00:05:22.230
You managed to save your hide.

00:05:26.780 --> 00:05:32.160
I have ordered the destruction of the Haniwa and the safe retrieval of the Miitsu.

00:05:32.910 --> 00:05:38.790
You reckon Kuromitsu's actually there, Hasegawa?

00:05:38.790 --> 00:05:40.000
I do.

00:05:40.790 --> 00:05:43.210
At last, we've found our eighth lead to her whereabouts.

00:05:43.960 --> 00:05:46.130
I hope this one actually leads to her...

00:05:46.960 --> 00:05:52.930
Over the last thousand years, so many chances have slipped through my fingers.

00:05:53.840 --> 00:05:57.930
This time, using these hands...

00:06:23.580 --> 00:06:26.500
You truly cherish this scenery...

00:06:27.420 --> 00:06:29.750
I never tire of it, despite my various sojourns here.

00:06:30.170 --> 00:06:31.800
Do you despise it?

00:06:33.050 --> 00:06:36.760
How could I despise a place that brings you such joy?

00:07:48.710 --> 00:07:51.590
Why do you weep?

00:08:06.430 --> 00:08:08.600
The name of this flower...

00:08:09.230 --> 00:08:10.860
The White Deadnettle?

00:08:11.270 --> 00:08:12.320
No.

00:08:13.110 --> 00:08:15.320
The world may call it such,

00:08:16.400 --> 00:08:18.950
but I address it differently.

00:08:20.410 --> 00:08:21.700
I call it...

00:08:40.140 --> 00:08:41.140
So, you're awake.

00:08:41.640 --> 00:08:42.800
We're leaving.

00:08:42.800 --> 00:08:44.140
Get ready.

00:08:44.760 --> 00:08:46.140
Don't dawdle.

00:08:46.140 --> 00:08:47.600
We don't have time.

00:08:52.020 --> 00:08:53.980
Saniwa will meet you.

00:08:54.940 --> 00:08:57.610
She said she'd verify something with you.

00:08:59.650 --> 00:09:01.110
Something?

00:09:07.910 --> 00:09:09.580
I'll be in charge of your sword.

00:09:18.340 --> 00:09:21.720
We also need to blindfold you till we get there.

00:09:51.920 --> 00:09:54.580
Has the snake started its hibernation this year?

00:09:54.580 --> 00:09:58.300
Not yet. It'll hibernate when the snow falls.

00:09:58.590 --> 00:09:59.550
Go on through.

00:09:59.550 --> 00:10:00.510
Thanks.

00:10:28.410 --> 00:10:30.700
Don't make any false moves.

00:10:31.290 --> 00:10:33.750
I don't wanna have to shoot you.

00:10:52.930 --> 00:10:54.230
Wait here.

00:10:54.980 --> 00:10:58.190
You can remove the blindfold when I've left.

00:11:29.140 --> 00:11:31.390
Hey, Izana.

00:11:31.390 --> 00:11:35.270
Giving away the location of our leader to a stranger is bad enough,

00:11:35.270 --> 00:11:38.020
but why must we take him there too?

00:11:38.690 --> 00:11:42.360
We don't need to verify his skills or abilities.

00:11:42.360 --> 00:11:44.030
Saniwa will do that.

00:11:44.610 --> 00:11:46.780
Each person has a specific role.

00:11:46.780 --> 00:11:49.700
Saniwa can scrutinize the contents of any man's heart.

00:11:50.200 --> 00:11:53.620
I remain here to protect the Miitsu.

00:11:54.250 --> 00:11:55.620
The Miitsu...

00:13:36.310 --> 00:13:37.640
What's wrong?

00:13:41.440 --> 00:13:42.480
We'll go there now.

00:15:10.440 --> 00:15:11.650
My beloved Kuro.

00:15:12.280 --> 00:15:15.110
Kuromitsu, what holds you to this place?

00:15:16.450 --> 00:15:18.830
My beloved has truly arrived.

00:15:20.160 --> 00:15:21.870
Tread carefully.

00:15:22.700 --> 00:15:28.080
Those driven by bloodlust desire to draw us in.

00:15:35.510 --> 00:15:37.260
How can this be?

00:15:37.260 --> 00:15:38.340
Kuromitsu!

00:15:38.340 --> 00:15:43.270
So, your true self is still unknown to you.

00:15:44.100 --> 00:15:48.270
Others fear our kind because we imbibe blood.

00:15:48.690 --> 00:15:51.650
Sometimes, their intent is to slaughter us.

00:15:51.650 --> 00:15:52.650
Kuromitsu!

00:15:52.650 --> 00:15:54.190
Please, come no closer.

00:15:55.820 --> 00:16:01.160
This vestige you now gaze upon is not my tangible form.

00:16:02.370 --> 00:16:05.580
Soon, we will truly meet each other again.

00:16:10.920 --> 00:16:18.130
Until that moment comes, do not forget all the words we have exchanged in our past lives.

00:16:28.100 --> 00:16:29.140
Kuromitsu!

00:17:02.430 --> 00:17:03.430
Cease and desist!

00:17:12.230 --> 00:17:15.730
Kuon, is this how you treat a guest?

00:17:17.740 --> 00:17:22.410
I was simply finding out whether he had what it takes to join us.

00:17:23.910 --> 00:17:25.410
Sir Kuro.

00:17:25.410 --> 00:17:28.910
Please forgive the ignorance of this impetuous oaf.

00:17:29.460 --> 00:17:33.290
Only a moment ago, my eyes witnessed an illusion of some sort; what caused it?

00:17:33.750 --> 00:17:39.630
We fed a hallucinogen through the fluorescent tube so you could recall your memories.

00:17:40.170 --> 00:17:45.220
Sir Kuro, you know the name of this flower, correct?

00:17:45.970 --> 00:17:48.350
The name the two of you have given it.

00:17:49.680 --> 00:17:50.890
The luminous light:

00:17:51.810 --> 00:17:53.310
Phosphorescence.

00:17:54.940 --> 00:17:59.610
In the twilight, it emits a luminescence of such brightness.

00:18:00.740 --> 00:18:02.450
Kuromitsu referred to it by this name.

00:18:03.950 --> 00:18:05.740
We would gaze at the flower,

00:18:05.740 --> 00:18:10.750
hoping that the moment would last for all eternity.

00:18:12.370 --> 00:18:15.040
So, why is this flower...?

00:18:17.840 --> 00:18:21.220
Lady Kuromitsu spoke to me of this flower.

00:18:23.180 --> 00:18:24.140
Sir Kuro.

00:18:24.970 --> 00:18:29.260
If you wish to relive those moments with Lady Kuromitsu,

00:18:30.180 --> 00:18:35.560
I will gladly lead you to her place of rest.

00:18:37.980 --> 00:18:40.610
I will meet her again?

00:18:40.610 --> 00:18:41.780
Indeed.

00:18:44.320 --> 00:18:45.360
Madam Saniwa.

00:18:49.700 --> 00:18:50.910
What did you say?

00:19:17.270 --> 00:19:18.270
Izana!

00:19:46.180 --> 00:19:48.680
Damn Red Army...

00:19:49.010 --> 00:19:51.310
How dare they come here.

00:19:51.310 --> 00:19:53.810
Karuta, my sword.

00:19:58.940 --> 00:20:01.070
R-Right!

00:20:13.180 --> 00:20:28.170
Next Chapter

00:20:18.450 --> 00:20:28.170
Miitsu
